    <comp lib="11" loc="(497,20)" name="Text">
      <a name="text">User inputs:
 w - accelerate ball upwards
 gravity - how fast the ball accelerates
How to play:
* Set clock to around 32Hz, enable auto-ticks
* Set gravity to slightly positive
* Press 'w' button, or type 'w' to make
  the ball bounce</a>
    </comp>
